# youcoded
===
 YouCoded is an open-source, multi-model AI assistant that helps you work with files, projects, research, and everyday tasks. Its own permission-based agent can use tools, skills, and specialists; you choose the AI behind it: a local model on your computer, a cloud provider or API key, a ChatGPT plan, or Claude Code as a first-class integration.
